# CascadePSP-family checkpoints (ResNet50-based, ~260MB+): excluded for two reasons, not
# just size. (1) Exceed GitHub's 100MB hard limit -- would need distributing as Release
# assets. (2) CascadePSP itself was deliberately rejected 2026-07-25/26 on licensing-
# provenance grounds (its base weights' own upstream training data licenses were never
# independently audited) despite genuinely good measured quality -- see
# docs/ml_strategy_history.md "CascadePSP finetuned on P&C" and the generation-6 pivot
# entry. Kept on disk (not deleted) but never git-tracked either way.
# SmallUNet checkpoints (~14MB, everything else in data/models/) stay tracked as before.
